        "original_id": "2cd69379-4732-5b37-90f2-97cbe3487262",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Milo Parker, Callan McAuliffe, Ben Kingsley, Gillian Anderson, Anke Engelke, Bastian Pastewka\n- Films: Robot Overlords, Ghost Hunters on Icy Trails, Mr. Holmes, Miss Peregrine's Home for Peculiar Children\n- Roles: Connor, Roger Munro, Hugh Apiston, Hugo\n- Topics: British child actors, science fiction films, comedy films\n\nFacts:\n- Milo Parker, born in 2002, is a British child actor.\n- In the 2014 British independent science fiction film Robot Overlords, Milo Parker played Connor.\n- Robot Overlords was originally titled Our Robot Overlords and starred Callan McAuliffe, Ben Kingsley, and Gillian Anderson.\n- In the 2015 German-Austrian-Irish comedy film Ghost Hunters on Icy Trails, Milo Parker starred alongside Anke Engelke and Bastian Pastewka, who voiced Hugo.\n- Milo Parker is also known for playing Roger Munro in Mr. Holmes.\n- Milo Parker is also known for playing Hugh Apiston in Miss Peregrine's Home for Peculiar Children.",
